# --- Line ending normalization ---
# This project has had a recurring, inconsistent mix of CRLF and LF line
# endings across otherwise-identical PHP files (observed repeatedly
# during this session's PSR-12 checks). Normalizing everything to LF in
# the repository - regardless of which OS a contributor commits from -
# prevents diffs made up entirely of line-ending changes and keeps
# git blame/history meaningful.
* text=auto eol=lf

# --- Binary files ---
# Must never be subject to line-ending conversion, which would corrupt
# them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary

# --- Generated / minified files ---
# These are build output derived from their non-minified counterparts,
# not hand-edited source - mark them as generated so GitHub's diff view
# collapses them by default and they're excluded from language
# statistics.
*.min.js linguist-generated
*.min.css linguist-generated

# --- git archive / distribution package ---
# Excluded from "git archive" output (e.g. GitHub's auto-generated
# release zips) - development-only tooling that a consumer of the
# installed module doesn't need. RockLanguage/ and languages/ are
# intentionally NOT listed here, since both ship real, user-facing
# translations (RockLanguage/ for users who have that module installed,
# languages/ for everyone else).
tests/          export-ignore
README.md       export-ignore
CHANGELOG.md    export-ignore
images/         export-ignore
Examples/       export-ignore
composer.json   export-ignore
composer.lock   export-ignore
phpunit.xml     export-ignore
.gitattributes  export-ignore
.gitignore      export-ignore
.editorconfig   export-ignore
